            <chunk name="Object" index="7">
              <items count="2">
                <item name="GUID" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">59e0b89a-e487-49f8-bab8-b5bab16be14c</item>
                <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Panel</item>
              </items>
              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="8">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">A panel for custom notes and text values</item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">223d8e4d-88f5-43b2-bb4f-6c09c5f4ed38</item>
                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Panel</item>
                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10"></item>
                    <item name="Optional" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="ScrollRatio" type_name="gh_double" type_code="6">0</item>
                    <item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">IN BETWEEN / FRAME MORPH
ONE CONTROL: frame_open. -1 contracted / 0 reference / +1 fully expanded.
Only the left and right outer posts move horizontally. Fixed rail length = 100 mm.
Outer red grows and its hole closes; at +1 it is an exact solid sphere. Inner red grows as that hole shrinks.
Blue half-disc morphs into a four-sided field. Yellow revolves about the right post into a cone; the blue foot becomes an intersection-centred oblong. Blue growth cuts away the black corner.</item>
                  </items>
                  <chunks count="2">
                    <chunk name="Attributes">
                      <items count="4">
                        <item name="Bounds" type_name="gh_drawing_rectanglef" type_code="35">
                          <X>30</X>
                          <Y>15</Y>
                          <W>1180</W>
                          <H>100</H>
                        </item>
                        <item name="MarginLeft" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                        <item name="MarginRight" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                        <item name="MarginTop" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                      </items>
                    </chunk>
                    <chunk name="PanelProperties">
                      <items count="7">
                        <item name="Colour" type_name="gh_drawing_color" type_code="36">
                          <ARGB>255;255;255;255</ARGB>
                        </item>
                        <item name="DrawIndices" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">true</item>
                        <item name="DrawPaths" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">true</item>
                        <item name="Multiline" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">true</item>
                        <item name="SpecialCodes" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                        <item name="Stream" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                        <item name="Wrap" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">true</item>
                      </items>
                    </chunk>
                  </chunks>
                </chunk>
              </chunks>
            </chunk>
            <chunk name="Object" index="8">
              <items count="2">
                <item name="GUID" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">59e0b89a-e487-49f8-bab8-b5bab16be14c</item>
                <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Panel</item>
              </items>
              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="8">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">A panel for custom notes and text values</item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">0fdd4a45-784e-427b-b442-68d612783b3b</item>
                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Panel</item>
                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10"></item>
                    <item name="Optional" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="ScrollRatio" type_name="gh_double" type_code="6">0</item>
                    <item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">DEPENDENCIES
frame_open -&gt; outer-post positions -&gt; red orb / hole -&gt; blue field + inner red.
left-post position -&gt; black base / blue oblong; right-post position -&gt; yellow cone axis.
At +1 outer posts end at rail intersections; the black corner is consumed by the blue field. No global scale, rotation, variants or separate local shape sliders.</item>
                  </items>
                  <chunks count="2">
                    <chunk name="Attributes">
                      <items count="4">
                        <item name="Bounds" type_name="gh_drawing_rectanglef" type_code="35">
                          <X>30</X>
                          <Y>780</Y>
                          <W>1180</W>
                          <H>95</H>
                        </item>
                        <item name="MarginLeft" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                        <item name="MarginRight" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                        <item name="MarginTop" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
